{"id":3812,"date":"2017-06-18T16:08:02","date_gmt":"2017-06-18T20:08:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3812"},"modified":"2017-06-18T16:08:02","modified_gmt":"2017-06-18T20:08:02","slug":"rc-jets-so-cool","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/06\/18\/rc-jets-so-cool\/","title":{"rendered":"RC Jets &#8211; So COOL!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Each year, on the first Friday and Saturday in June, the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.lcmfa.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lake County Modelers and Flyers Association<\/a> holds their annual RC Jet Rally at the Baldwin Municipal Airport.<\/p>\n<p>This event is free and open to the public for all to come and see what it&#8217;s all about. \u00a0Kathy and I took a drive over on Friday to see what this was all about. \u00a0So COOL!<\/p>\n<p>Although I never owned one, when I was younger some of my buddies had RC airplanes or RC boats, but JETS? \u00a0Really? \u00a0JETS?<\/p>\n<p>These guys and gals have a club and, like most clubs, I&#8217;m sure they meet periodically and share ideas and talk about the art of building these beautiful birds and of course, learning to fly these things at fantastic speeds without crashing.<\/p>\n<p>Although we didn&#8217;t talk to any of the participants, no questions asked, still we enjoyed see how beautiful (and fast) these guys are. \u00a0Some of them are up to about 6 feet long!<\/p>\n<p>I hope you enjoy seeing these pix in the slide show below and check out the video I shot too that shows just how fast these guys shoot across the sky.<\/p>\n<p>Although I&#8217;d like to play with these (like to have one of my own), I&#8217;m sure the average RC Jet hobbyist has thousands invested (too rich for my blood) and further, we&#8217;d have a hard time transporting one of these guys in the motor home.<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy &#8230;<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3812 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-large'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.11.46.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.11.46-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3814\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.11.46-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.11.46-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.11.46-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.11.46.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3814'>\n\t\t\t\tCheck out the little pilot!\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.07.39.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.07.39-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3815\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.07.39-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.07.39-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.07.39-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.07.39.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3815'>\n\t\t\t\tDisplay board set up at the rally\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.48.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.48-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.48-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.48-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.48-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.48.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.09.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.09-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3817\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.09-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.09-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.09-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.09.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3817'>\n\t\t\t\tMany have camped the night and set up tents with tables to work on their aircraft\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.05.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.05-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" aria-describedby=\"gallery-1-3818\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.05-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.05-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.05-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.06.05.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<figcaption class='wp-caption-text gallery-caption' id='gallery-1-3818'>\n\t\t\t\tJets lined up in queue to fly\n\t\t\t\t<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.03.24.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.03.24-1024x576.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.03.24-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.03.24-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.03.24-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/06\/2017-06-09-14.03.24.jpg 760w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 685px) 100vw, 685px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-conte